  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -AR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "Past participle: ordenado (regular)",
    "*Ordenar la habitación* = to tidy the room",
    "*Ordenar algo* = to order/arrange something: *Ordenó los libros por color* = He arranged the books by colour",
    "*Ordenar a alguien que* + subjuntivo = to order someone to: *Le ordenó que se sentara* = He ordered him to sit down",
    "Related: el orden (order), ordenado/a (tidy, orderly), el ordenador (computer — Spain)"
  ],
